1505,"row":{"en":"What did they think the future held?","wo":"Lu ñu yaakaaroon ni noonu la ëlëg nara mel?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLou gnou yakaron ni nonou la euleuk nara mel ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1506,"row":{"en":"She said that we should give Cocoa some hay to eat, which is a good source of fiber.","wo":"Muni dañu wara wutal Cocoa ñax mu lekk, ndax ñax dafa bari fibre.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoungui daniou wara woutal cocoa niakh mou leke, ndakh niakh dafa bari fibre.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1507,"row":{"en":"We've been investigating this tree for weeks, said a raven.","wo":"Korbóo bi daal di waxni, ay ayu-bis a ngi nuy saytu garab gii.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKorbo bi daldi wakhni ay ayou bisse angi nouy saytou garab gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1508,"row":{"en":"The process of donating blood was actually pretty simple.","wo":"Ndeke maye deret lu yomb la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdeké mayé déret lou yombe la\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1509,"row":{"en":"It was a reminder of a better time, when I was young and free and full of hope.","wo":"Daf ma doon fàttali sama ndaw, jamono yi ma amul woon benn xalaatu àdduna bari yaakaar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafma doon fatali sama ndaw, diamono yima amoul wone bene khalattou addouna bari yakar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1510,"row":{"en":"Malawi is a diverse country with a rich culture and history.","wo":"Malawi réew mu yaatu la ci taarix ak ci cosaan ak aada.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMalawi rew mou yatou la thi taarikh ak thi cosane ak aada.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1511,"row":{"en":"That’s absurd, and it’s embarrassing, and anybody thinking that way should be ashamed, no matter their preference.","wo":"Rafetul, ruslu na, te képp kuy xalaatee noonu war na rus ci boppam, ak lu seen tànn