sh to survive!","wo":"Sudee fi ñuy jeulé dundu gi lu ndaw la, jën yu magg yi dina ñu lekk jën yu ndaw yi ngir mëna dundu!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou déé fi gnuy dieulé doundou gui lou ndaw la, dieun you magui yi dina gnou lekk dieun you ndaw yi nguir meuna doundou !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1517,"row":{"en":"All travel guides describe every country as beautiful and lovely.","wo":"Bépp guide turistik lu baax ak rafet lay wax ci réew mu nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeupp guide touristique lou bakh ak rafet lay wakh si rew mou nekk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1518,"row":{"en":"The streets were crowded with people, all eager to see the latest and greatest in lockmaking technology.","wo":"Bedd yaa ngi feesoon dell ak nit, ñépp yàkkamtee gis loke yi mujjee génn ak xaralay loke yi gëna mag.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBedd ya ngui fésone dell ak nitt, gnép yakamti guiss loké yi moudié guénn ak kharalay loké yi geuna mag.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1519,"row":{"en":"It's a simple act of kindness that can help save lives.","wo":"Jëf ju baax la juy muccal nit, te yomb naa def.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDieuf djou bakh la djouy mouthial nitt té yomb na def.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1520,"row":{"en":"There are others who share my burden.","wo":"Amna ñeneen ñuy dundu lu mettee nii.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmna gnénéne gnoy doundou lou mété nii.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1521,"row":{"en":"Is there a clown on the premises?","wo":"Ndax barab bi amna clown?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdakh barab bi amna clown?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1522,"row":{"en":"Hospitals are often classified by the type of care they provide, such as general hospitals, specialty hospitals, and psychiatric hospitals.","wo":"Hopitaal yi dañu leen di klaase ci xeetu paj mi ñuy def, lu mel