 flow and the release of chemicals in the injured tissue.","wo":"Liy waral màndarga yooyu ñooy li deret ji di gëna daw, ak substance yi ñuy bàyyi ci tisu bi gaañu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi waral mandarga yoyou gnoy li deret dji di geuna daw ak substance yi gnuy bayi si tissu bi ganiu.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1529,"row":{"en":"double","wo":"ñaari yoon ful ñaari yoon","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\ngnari yoon foul gnari yoon\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1530,"row":{"en":"The internet is more than facebook chats, twitter memes, and instagram pictures.","wo":"Internet yamul ci waxtaani facebook, siiwal dara ci twitter, ak nataali instagram.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nInternet yamoul thi wakhtani facebook, siwal dara thi twitter ak natali instagram.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1531,"row":{"en":"The soap opera ends with a message of hope.","wo":"Fëyëtoŋ baa ngi jeexee ci yaakaar gu mag.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFeuyeuton ba ngui diekhé ci yakar gou mag.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1532,"row":{"en":"These markets are a great place to sample local cuisine.","wo":"Marse luuma yi ngay fekk xeetu toggi dëkk bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMarsé loumayi ngay fekk kheutou togui deuk bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1533,"row":{"en":"It was a total nightmare.","wo":"Xaw nañu ma yóbbu laaxira.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhaw nagnou ma yobou lakhira\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1534,"row":{"en":"Like an unlawful assembly, a riot involves a gathering of persons for an illegal purpose.","wo":"Emeute ay nit yu dajaloo ci ludul yoon ñoo koy amal, te duñu def lu yoon santaane.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nEmeute ay nitt you dadialo si loudoul yoon nio koy amal té dougnou def lou yoon santaané.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1535,"row":{"en":"I have lost friends and family, and my relationships have suffered.","wo":"Ñàkk naa ay xarit ak ay mbokk, ba noppi indi jafe-jafe ci sama diggante ak kima nekkal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnak na ay kharit ak ay mbok ba noppi indi diafé diafé si sama diguenté ak kima nekal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1536,"row":{"en":"It is a fire that burns from within, consuming us with its flames.","wo":"Daa melni sébb bu tàkk ci biir, diñu lakk ci xalam yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDaa melni seubb bou takk thi biir, dignou lakk thi khalam yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1537,"row":{"en":"You should also avoid using sharp objects on your cork flooring, as this can damage the surface.","wo":"Danga wara moytu jëfandikoo mbir yu ñaw wala lu am cat lu sew ndax mën na yàq li ci kaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDanga wara moytou dieufandiko mbir you gnaw wala lou ame thiat lou sew ndakh meun na yak li thi kaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1538,"row":{"en":"Each movement is carefully choreographed to express a specific emotion or idea.","wo":"Bépp tànk boo teg dafay màndargaal benn yëg-yëg wala xalaat.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeup tank bo tegg dafay mandargal benn yeug yeug wala khalat\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1539,"row":{"en":"They admitted him to the hospital and began treatment.","wo":"Ñu daal koy tëye ci hopital bi, daal di tàmbali paj mi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou daal koy teuye thie hopital bi daal di tambali padj mi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1540,"row":{"en":"Gandhi also believed rural economy based mass movement follow non-violent methods.","wo":"Gandhi dafa gëmoon ni ekonomi bu askan wi yépp jàpp moo topp ci xeex bi amul fitna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGandhi dafa geumon ni economie bou askane wi yeup diap mo top thi khekh bi amoul fitna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1541,